        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Burning of 1 g diesel in locomotive with particle filter (93%)
na;
UUID: ecc0cc51-5787-3098-b67f-40a0d6d25ca4
The inventory includes the emissions of burning 1 gram of diesel in a locomotive. It is assumed that 93% of the locomotives have a particle filter; Geography: Switzerland
Location:  Switzerland
Technology: Average technology
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Statistics 
